    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>Helena Taylor is among the most respected Kindred in Washington's Elysium, a leading harpy who administers much of Elysium for the Prince and manages the Tremere Chantry's daily affairs for Pontifex Dorfman. A prominent Getlin Oil Company lobbyist, she preys almost exclusively on senators and congressmen. Her deepest secret is her mortal past as an Order of Hermes mage; her former apprentice Trevor Barron has come to Washington seeking to reclaim her, threatening everything she has built as a Tremere.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>You smile at everyone and strive to make a charming impression. Few things ruffle your feathers, and if something does, you pretend otherwise. You prefer to reason your way out of situations rather than resort to violence.</p>",
    "notes": "Sire: Jack Weston. Disciplines (as printed): Auspex 3, Dominate 5, Presence 1, Protean 3, Thaumaturgy 4 (Paths: Movement of the Mind 5, Lure of Flames 4, Weather Control 3, Conjuring 1). Haven: mansion near Ward Circle, NE D.C. Secrets: A-. Convert Disciplines/Thaumaturgy Paths by adding owned power Items from the disciplines compendium at Storyteller discretion.",
    "npcType": "vampire"
  },
